 going to walk or take a taxi. It's up to you.", "time": "24000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le17ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "Welcome to The Tango Museum in Buenos Aires.  The museum first opened in 2003. It has many photographs and artifacts displaying the history of Argentina's most famous dance, the tango. The tango has both European and African influences.", "time": "1"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "The name is believed to come from the African word \u201ctango\u201d, meaning drum. The dance originates from the 1890s. It is a kind of ballroom dance that you do with a partner. We are going to learn how to dance the tango while we are here in Buenos Aires.", "time": "17000"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "I hope you brought your dancing shoes! The dancing school is about 5 miles from here, so we are going to walk or take a taxi. It's up to you.", "time": "32500"}], "video_src": "engenn4le17ob02re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}